on:** The `space.yaml` was patched to include the new design specifications.\\n\\n### Technical Details\\n*   **Image Path:** `C:\\\\HermesPortable\\\\home\\\\spaces\\\\finanz-junkie\\\\public\\\\images\\\\fj_{slug}.png`\\n*   **Queue Server:** Port `8283` using `sdxl-lightning`.\\n*   **Build Script:** `build_site.py` was used to assemble the magazine-style layout.\\n*   **Deployment URL:** `https://52488587.finanz-junkie.pages.dev`\\n\\n### Unresolved / Notable\\n*   The assistant noted a known bug where the queue server occasionally reports a \\\"failed\\\" status even when the image is successfully generated.\\n*   The conversation concluded with the user requesting that these new images be integrated directly into the **Windows 8-inspired Metro tile overlay** on the front page, which was the next task in progress.\"}], \"count\": 3, \"sessions_searched\": 3}",
