      "name": "skill_view",
      "snippet": "{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"provider-pool\", \"file\": \"references/horde-integration.md\", \"content\": \"# Horde Integration — Details\\n\\n## API Key\\n`njolKkbw88RDSESdriVoqg` (Account: PupCid#493646)\\n\\n## Direct API Usage (Python)\\n```python\\nimport urllib.request, json, time\\n\\nAPI_KEY = \\\"njolKkbw88RDSESdriVoqg\\\"\\nHORDE_URL = \\\"https://stablehorde.net/api/v2\\\"\\n\\ndef horde_request(method, path, data=None):\\n    url = f\\\"{HORDE_URL}{path}\\\"\\n    headers = {\\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\", \\\"apikey\\\": API_KEY}\\n    body = json.dumps(data).encode() if data else None\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=body, headers=headers, method=method)\\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=120) as resp:\\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\\n\\n# Image generieren\\nresult = horde_request(\\\"POST\\\", \\\"/generate/async\\\", {\\n    \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"a cute cat\\\",\\n    \\\"params\\\": {\\\"steps\\\": 25, \\\"cfg_scale\\\": 7, \\\"width\\\": 1024, \\\"height\\\": 1024},\\n    \\\"models\\\": [\\\"AlbedoBase XL (SDXL)\\\"],\\n})\\njob_id = result[\\\"id\\\"]\\n\\n# Poll\\nwhile True:\\n    status = horde_request(\\\"GET\\\", f\\\"/generate/status/{job_id}\\\")\\n    if status.get(\\\"done\\\"):\\n        img_url = status[\\\"generations\\\"][0][\\\"img\\\"]\\n        break\\n    time.sleep(5)\\n```\\n\\n## Worker Horde Worker Directories\\n- Worker-Source: `/c/HermesPortable/home/horde-worker-reGen/`\\n- Config: `bridgeData.yaml` (Low-VRAM eingestellt)\\n- Venv: `venv/Scripts/python.exe` (eigenes venv mit horde_sdk, torch, diffusers)\\n- Horde-Client (API-only, kein GPU): `/c/HermesPortable/home/scripts/horde_worker.py`\\n- Worker Starter: `/c/HermesPortable/home/scripts/start_horde_worker.py`\\n- Gen Queue Script (updated): `/c/HermesPortable/home/scripts/start_gen_queue.sh`\\n\\n## Known Issues\\n- Horde Worker ignoriert Umgebungsvariablen (HORDE_MAX_POWER etc.) — Config muss in bridgeData.yaml\\n- `pip install -e .` timed out wegen build deps — Workaround: `cp -r horde_worker_regen venv/Lib/site-packages/`\\n- Gen Queue subprocess exit code 1 trotz success → `SystemExit` wird in `finally` nicht korrekt behandelt\\n\", \"file_type\": \".md\"}",
