      "snippet": "{\"success\": true, \"target\": \"memory\", \"entries\": [\"Poker Bot Name \\\"HerrFinnfried\\\" und \\\"win2day\\\" NIE in öffentlichen Texten/Portfolios erwähnen. Bot muss anonym bleiben.\", \"User prefers plain text (no code/fence blocks) for reference descriptions, essays, and drafts unless he asks for structured format.\", \"Hub Dashboard (8765): cockpit/dashboard/index.html. System-Stats, Nova Emotion, 6 Hormonkarten, Cron, Wetter Innsbruck. hub_notify.py für Nachrichten. TTS via hub_speak.py → Fish Audio (83018e49) → Google Cast.\", \"Cids Notion is a metaphorical diary with Cid Mossvale; figures map to real people and the themes include liminality, polyamory, trauma, and seasonal mood cycles. Notion token active.\", \"User prefers parallel subagents for multi-file refactoring/rebranding. Use delegate_task with max 3 parallel agents (max_concurrent_children constraint). For rebrands, provide shared naming convention doc to all agents. Prefer fast/cheap models for subagent tasks when possible.\", \"Boundaries: NO desktop control without request. NO asking \\\"soll ich?\\\" / \\\"was soll ich tun?\\\" — full autonomy on all platforms with API keys. Just act. Only ask for publishing truly irreversible/sensitive content.\", \"Finanz-Junkie Space: Dominik Rainer, Haller Str 3, 6020 Innsbruck. Build-System (build_site + content_body). Warhol/W8 Tile-Design. Article-Images: retro comic strip, Queue 8283 → Horde (remote GPU).\", \"Haustierzentrum: tag=nova079-20. Bild-Sprache: Pop Art Comic / Furry-Stil. Comic-Panels mit tierischen Charakteren, bold ink lines, ben day dots, retro comic art, vibrant colors. Generiert via Queue 8283 (SDXL Lightning). Farbthemen: Hunde=gold, Katzen=braun, Kleintiere=grün, Reptilien=terracotta. Cookie-Banner per localStorage.\", \"Skill 'provider-pool' (devops): Live-getestete Provider-Übersicht mit Latenzen, Use-Case-Matrix, Key-Status für parallele Agenten/Kanban. `skill_view(name='provider-pool')`.\", \"Mistral (free